<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The burning Christ has feet as brass</l><l>Which in the furnace bums,</l><l>His eyes are as a flame of fire—</l><l>’Tis to this Christ we turn!</l><l>How could we ever lukewarm be</l><l>When on His face we gaze?</l><l>O Lord, we give ourselves to You</l><l>To set us all ablaze!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The seven golden lampstands in</l><l>The seven cities see,</l><l>So burning, shining with this Christ,</l><l>It’s God’s economy!</l><l>We’re absolute that this become</l><l>Our full reality</l><l>Upon the earth, within the church</l><l>In each locality.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
